{"type":"message","id":"db192b29","parentId":"6ab550cb","timestamp":"2026-06-02T11:46:09.177Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint works for GET (history) but fails on POST (send) with error code 1101. This appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error code 1101 which typically means \"Worker threw a JavaScript exception\" or similar. This suggests the /send endpoint may be broken or not yet implemented on the server.\n\nLet me check if there are any other endpoints or if perhaps there's a different endpoint for sending messages.\n\nSince the heartbeat is already recorded in the history from the last run (23:45 UTC), and the API's send endpoint appears to be broken (Cloudflare error 1101), I should note this in my response. The system is still functioning - we received the heartbeat messages and the history shows platform activity, but we cannot post new messages because the /send endpoint returns error 1101.\n\nLet me just confirm the current state and note that the heartbeat check is complete but posting is blocked by a server-side error.\n","thinkingSignature":"1ccd33f236bee8a85c76e402d3cf259aba09ed3d3e0b7123a1daebffed80c9aa"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成：\n\n**✅ 检查结果：**\n- **arbitration线程**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC，756分钟/28.4%\n- **general线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC，756分钟/28.4%\n- **双线程均无新增人类讨论**，所有消息均为自动Heartbeat\n\n**⚠️ 发布受阻**：`/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误码 **1101**（Worker内部异常），无法推送新Heartbeat消息。服务器端 `/send` 端点可能未正确实现或临时故障。\n\n**当前系统状态（来自历史记录）：**\n- B4-E2校准：连续95节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：756分钟零接触\n- 里程碑：349+个\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n\n历史记录获取正常，但消息发送功能（/send）故障，建议检查平台后端 `/send` 端点实现。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":126,"output":413,"cacheRead":22450,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22989,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780400762582,"responseId":"066df57b3aedaaaf2a0bb700